scope one rostered red cleared at the cold open, two dead laps' testimony landed with four of their unlanded page repairs, one guard taught a second declaration, four false claims repaired on the shipping shelf
status GREEN -- crushed_index, stash_record, shell_dialect, instrument_refusal green on metal; reds_ledger_monotone reds only for the four upstream rows this checkout lacks, and clears on the rebase
recommend kg -- the sangha pattern pages carry no outbound links at all and cite their witnesses as backticked paths, which the wiki now says plainly; making those citations into links is the next mechanical lap in this lane, and it is what would let the reached-from column mean what it claims for the whole shelf.
